      "question": "RecordPickerDialog's copy (site 6) has no object-name guard. With objectName === '' and a loaded policy it asks checkField('', key, 'read') for every key; for an authenticated MePermissionsProvider an unknown object answers false, so it strips the row. The export, like the other seven sites, passes the row through for ''. Convert site 6 to the export, keep its private copy, or tighten the export?",
